  "definition": "Medical Eligibility",
  "effectiveDate": "2007-04-13",
  "historyNote": "#2484, eff 9-26-83; ss by #4167, eff 11-6-86; ss by #4638, eff 6-26-89, EXPIRED: 6-26-95 New. #8864, eff 4-13-07",
